From c52e4b7c11084d5c750b979425cfe914dc65ab92 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huzayfa <majanovhyzayfa@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:53:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Close the audit findings and prepare the P0-1 deployment

Security: attachment ACL by owner/admin, 15-minute file tokens bound to the
subject, lead sanitising, a partial unique index for PENDING registrations
with 409 on conflict, NUL-byte rejection before PostgreSQL, a single JSON
error envelope for body-parser failures, and /docs plus /metrics disabled in
production.

Database: 79 missing FK indexes and ON DELETE rules for 13 foreign keys
(CASCADE where children are meaningless without the parent, SET NULL for
optional references, RESTRICT where the row is a live document), verified by
`prisma migrate diff` on a clean database.

Features: certificate files are served through an ADMIN-only API route and
stored as /api/certificates/:id/file; empty uploads return 400 instead of a
broken file; access logs carry the client IP.

Cleanup: dead files, dependencies, exports, types, variables and CSS classes
removed; no-unused-vars is an error in oxlint; the admin SPA loads routes
lazily and vendors in separate chunks.

Also adds docs/deployment/P0_fix.md, the owner runbook for the 503
API_NOT_CONFIGURED blocker.
