+package.json (nodemailer 7.0.13 vs ^10.6.1, prisma 6.16 vs ^6.19.3) and the
+backend image, which installs only apps/api, failed to build with
+"npm error code EUSAGE". The backend job now reproduces that install.
+
+The pooled DATABASE_URL no longer carries schema=public: Prisma sends it as a
+search_path startup parameter and PgBouncer in transaction mode rejects it, so
+the backend crash-looped instead of becoming healthy. Failing bring-up steps
+publish the tail of their output as a check-run annotation, because downloading
+job logs needs admin rights on the repository.
 
